+def animation_for_display(app, mode: AgentMode):
+    """Resolve the animation for `app`, including any arrival it is playing.
+
+    A plain function taking the app rather than a method, because the LED sync
+    paths are also driven directly - by tests and by the remote-link sender -
+    with stand-ins that carry settings and nothing else. Routing every device
+    path through one resolver is what stops a path being added later that
+    forgets about arrivals, which is exactly what happened before.
