+    A single signal always resolves through the ordinary settings lookup, so
+    the authored animation - including a user's own custom program, such as the
+    two-minute purple heartbeat - is used untouched. Composition only takes
+    over when priority would otherwise be throwing information away.
+
+    Deliberately a plain function rather than a method: the LED sync paths are
+    also driven directly, by tests and by the remote-link sender, with stand-ins
+    for the app object that carry settings and nothing else.
+    """
